  Minigame2Script:
  - Ah, cook. You're here. Let us begin.
  - Today, we'll review [insert objective here]
  - Let's get started, eh?
  Minigame3Script:
  - Ah, cook. You're here. Let us begin.
  - Today, we'll review [insert objective here]
  - Let's get started, eh?
  Minigame1Dialogue:
  - text: Ah, cook. You're here. Let us begin.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cec9cb545caebc3499997be9556a87c1, type: 3}
  - text: Today, we're going to check how your knowledge of cooking terms has come
      along.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69b279b895560564bb327bc52dd20f8c, type: 3}
  - text: This might prove more difficult than what you're used to.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0cede20db2cb1a94f9715e7ff2b7b5c5, type: 3}
  - text: But, I'm sure you'll manage.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69b279b895560564bb327bc52dd20f8c, type: 3}
  - text: Let's begin, shall we?
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cec9cb545caebc3499997be9556a87c1, type: 3}
  Minigame2Dialogue:
  - text: Welcome back, today's task will be simple.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69b279b895560564bb327bc52dd20f8c, type: 3}
  - text: Simply follow my instructions.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cec9cb545caebc3499997be9556a87c1, type: 3}
  - text: We'll have a tasty meal in no time!
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cec9cb545caebc3499997be9556a87c1, type: 3}
  - text: Let's get started.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69b279b895560564bb327bc52dd20f8c, type: 3}
  Minigame3Dialogue:
  - text: Hello there, Chef!
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69b279b895560564bb327bc52dd20f8c, type: 3}
  - text: Oh wait, thats me. Sorry, cook.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cec9cb545caebc3499997be9556a87c1, type: 3}
  - text: Anyway, today, we'll be checking how well you can tell knives apart.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69b279b895560564bb327bc52dd20f8c, type: 3}
  - text: Just be careful not to cut yourself, alright?
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0cede20db2cb1a94f9715e7ff2b7b5c5, type: 3}
  - text: We'll begin whenever you're ready!
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69b279b895560564bb327bc52dd20f8c, type: 3}
